  "description": "WEMPAJ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n n c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H146 Gd9 O42 S8 9+,2(C1 H4 O1),9(Cl1 1-),3.36(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 10 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2C (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2D (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2E (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2F (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2G (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.631-5.134 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.10-174.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula {[Gd9(μ5-OH)2(μ3-OH)8(CH3OH)2(TC4A)2(H2O)24]Cl9}·3.36DMF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ5-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 24 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
